[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 9121.59, "timestamp": "02:32:01", "text": "好的。 所以我打算每"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9140.309, "timestamp": "02:32:20", "text": "嗯，是的，不管"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9146.469, "timestamp": "02:32:26", "text": "我是否在线。 是的，我"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9148.07, "timestamp": "02:32:28", "text": "希望你继续跑下去。 是的。 是的。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9158.63, "timestamp": "02:32:38", "text": "现在有人会问，乔，为什么你需要"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9160.71, "timestamp": "02:32:40", "text": "一个不同的按钮呢？ 为什么不能把它们"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9164.469, "timestamp": "02:32:44", "text": "合并成一个按钮呢？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9166.469, "timestamp": "02:32:46", "text": "正确的。 问得好。 如果你曾经"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9168.95, "timestamp": "02:32:48", "text": "想过这个问题，是的，与其用"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9171.67, "timestamp": "02:32:51", "text": "这些，我不如为此制作一副牌。 所以，我当时"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9174.309, "timestamp": "02:32:54", "text": "就想，从某种意义上说，这个人就是总"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9176.63, "timestamp": "02:32:56", "text": "指挥官。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 9178.87, "timestamp": "02:32:58", "text": "我觉得我不需要。是的，我"}]